{
"sections":[
{
"key":"why_this_person",
"empty":false,
"items":[
{
"h2":"\"VP of Marketing\" leads a team scaling from \"early stage growth and post-IPO scale\"",
"body":[
{"text":"Nick Fisher holds the title \"VP of Marketing\" and acts as a \"vp\"-level economic buyer for our solution.","claimIds":["zaf-038","zaf-041"]},
{"text":"Before joining Zafran Security in April 2024, he established marketing functions at Sysdig, Okta, and Lookout while holding progressively senior titles.","claimIds":["zaf-045"]},
{"text":"This background means he possesses deep expertise \"building teams for early stage growth and post-IPO scale\".","claimIds":["zaf-044"]}
],
"sendLine":"In your email: As someone who has built marketing teams for \"early stage growth and post-IPO scale,\" I thought you might appreciate how we're helping other security leaders accelerate pipeline.",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Published article proving \"how 96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching\"",
"body":[
{"text":"In his LinkedIn article titled \"Why I joined Zafran Security,\" he explains a discovery where \"we revealed how 96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching and can be mitigated using existing controls.\"","claimIds":["zaf-159","zaf-167"]},
{"text":"He builds his argument on the necessity of focusing purely on \"understanding real risk exposure\" instead of chasing false positives.","claimIds":["zaf-158"]},
{"text":"Leading with his exact metrics proves we studied his specific worldview before asking for a meeting.","claimIds":["zaf-158"]}
],
"sendLine":"In the platform: Frame your narrative around \"understanding real risk exposure,\" mirroring the language he used in his recent article.",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"MBA from \"Columbia Business School\" applies economics to cybersecurity",
"body":[
{"text":"Fisher earned his degree from \"Columbia Business School\" after completing an exchange at UC Berkeley Haas.","claimIds":["zaf-046"]},
{"text":"He listed \"Valuation\" and \"Capital Markets\" among his stated skills alongside technical competencies like \"Cybersecurity\" and \"Generative AI\".","claimIds":["zaf-049"]},
{"text":"Grounding our messaging in financial impact resonates with his background studying \"Economics\" at university.","claimIds":["zaf-046"]}
],
"sendLine":"In your email: Since you've anchored your strategy in economics and engineering, this data point connects directly to your metrics for vendor ROI.",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":2
}
]
},
{
"key":"problem_now",
"empty":false,
"items":[
{
"h2":"Building ABM \"from scratch\" while lacking major competitor tools",
"body":[
{"text":"Zafran Security is searching for a \"Senior Manager, ABM & Integrated Campaigns\" to manage a function officially categorized as \"being built from scratch\".","claimIds":["zaf-090"]},
{"text":"The job description states the incoming hire will \"Own ABM from the ground up\" across targeted and scaled motions.","claimIds":["zaf-090"]},
{"text":"Because they do not currently utilize platforms like \"6sense\", \"Demandbase\", or \"Terminus\", plugging directly into their existing \"HubSpot\" and \"Salesforce\" stack is vital.","claimIds":["zaf-089"]}
],
"sendLine":"On the landing page: \"You’re building your ABM program from scratch. Here is the playbook for 1:1 target mapping that aligns directly with HubSpot.\"",
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Two Regional Sales Manager roles sitting open for \"81 days\"",
"body":[
{"text":"Current headcount data shows 27 open requisitions distributed across departments like \"Sales\", \"R&D\", and \"Marketing\".","claimIds":["zaf-088"]},
{"text":"Notably, they are trying to fill a \"Regional Sales Manager (United Kingdom)\" and a \"Regional Sales Manager, Enterprise (DC, Maryland & Virginia)\", both of which have been posted for \"81 days\".","claimIds":["zaf-087"]},
{"text":"Slowing SDR placements delays ramp times and bottlenecks the immediate revenue pipeline.","claimIds":["zaf-087"]}
],
"sendLine":"In your email: I noticed your regional SDR roles have been open for nearly three months; our enriched data cuts list-building time by half so your new hires can hit quota faster.",
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Launching a partner channel \"from zero\" requiring new alliances staff",
"body":[
{"text":"The company is executing a \"strategic move\" to stand up a new partner ecosystem entirely from the beginning.","claimIds":["zaf-091"]},
{"text":"To lead this initiative, they posted a requirement for a \"Director of Alliances\" focused on Global Systems Integrators and technology partners.","claimIds":["zaf-091"]},
{"text":"Identifying these alliance contacts expands our ability to reach buying committees through co-marketing channels.","claimIds":["zaf-091"]}
],
"sendLine":"In the platform: Align your multi-channel sequences to trigger when alliance managers join, ensuring consistent messaging before they even ramp.",
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
}
]
},
{
"key":"openers",
"empty":false,
"items":[
{
"h2":"Running a YouTube channel focused on \"homemade spicy ginger syrup\" recipes",
"body":[
{"text":"Nick Fisher produces content for his personal project as a way to \"put out a regular cadence of videos\" for his subscribers.","claimIds":["zaf-103"]},
{"text":"He openly discusses the financial realities of his channel, calling it \"quite expensive and time consuming\" to maintain quality standards.","claimIds":["zaf-100"]},
{"text":"We should acknowledge his dedication to consistency and craftsmanship in a highly informal manner.","claimIds":["zaf-161"]},
{"text":"Use once, first line only.","claimIds":["zaf-161"]}
],
"sendLine":"In your email: I’ve been following your cocktail experiments—your dedication to putting out a regular cadence of videos really stands out.",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Proving \"how 96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching\" in a PoV",
"body":[
{"text":"In his professional writing detailing his career move, he documents a trial result where \"we revealed how 96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching and can be mitigated using existing controls.\"","claimIds":["zaf-159","zaf-167"]},
{"text":"He builds his argument on the necessity of focusing purely on genuine threat vectors.","claimIds":["zaf-158"]},
{"text":"Opening with his exact metrics proves we studied his specific worldview before asking for a meeting.","claimIds":["zaf-158"]}
],
"sendLine":"In your email: I read your notes on how \"96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching\"—that aligns perfectly with how we help buyers cut through scanner noise.",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Operating with a \"connections_count\" of 4776 on LinkedIn",
"body":[
{"text":"Fisher maintains a robust professional network, tracking \"6808\" followers and maintaining a \"connections_count\" of 4776.","claimIds":["zaf-050"]},
{"text":"He emphasizes community interaction by noting he will prioritize feedback directly from his supporters.","claimIds":["zaf-104"]},
{"text":"Using LinkedIn InMail respects his preference for interactive, community-driven dialogues.","claimIds":["zaf-050"]}
],
"sendLine":"In your email: Given your large follower count and direct engagement style, I wanted to share a brief insight specifically relevant to your network in security.",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":2
}
]
},
{
"key":"angles",
"empty":false,
"items":[
{
"h2":"Dropping physical assets in \"New York, New York\" HQ",
"body":[
{"text":"Zafran enforces a hybrid work structure, with requirements demanding \"approximately 3 days a week\" of in-office presence for front-facing roles.","claimIds":["zaf-092"]},
{"text":"Fisher operates out of \"New York, New York\", placing him within reach for localized physical touches.","claimIds":["zaf-042"]},
{"text":"Handing a direct-mail package directly to him circumvents digital ad fatigue and lands visibly on his desk.","claimIds":["zaf-042"]}
],
"sendLine":"In the direct-mail brief: Drop a premium spice kit or cocktail shaker with a note reading: \"Mixing high-performing pipeline, just like you mix your Moscow Mules.\"",
"contactRefs":[{"name":"Nick Fisher"}],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Promising to \"Turn fragmented scanner output into one actionable view\"",
"body":[
{"text":"Their messaging centers on solving alert fatigue by vowing to \"Turn fragmented scanner output into one actionable view.\"","claimIds":["zaf-136"]},
{"text":"They also commit to \"de-duplicate findings\" so security teams stop drowning in redundant tickets.","claimIds":["zaf-149"]},
{"text":"Mirroring this language on our campaign page validates their core pain point and positions us as the logical cleanup layer.","claimIds":["zaf-136"]}
],
"sendLine":"On the landing page: \"Most tools give you more alerts. We give you fewer problems. Here’s how we de-duplicate findings automatically.\"",
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Challenging peers by claiming they \"de-risks 90% of critical vulnerabilities overnight\"",
"body":[
{"text":"Zafran pushes highly specific performance metrics, asserting their system \"de-risks 90% of critical vulnerabilities overnight\" in hybrid environments.","claimIds":["zaf-127"]},
{"text":"They also claim their automation reduced manual effort from \"weeks to hours.\"","claimIds":["zaf-145"]},
{"text":"Matching their aggressive timeline expectations in our comparative whitepapers demonstrates equal confidence.","claimIds":["zaf-145"]}
],
"sendLine":"Brief the design agent with: Create a split-screen graphic contrasting \"Weeks to remEDIATE\" versus \"Hours\" to visualize our platform's speed advantage.",
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
}
]
},
