{"text":"Zafran secured a secondary infusion of capital labeled as an extension backed by Amex Ventures.","claimIds":["zaf-139"]},
{"text":"Disclosing this specific investor update to external prospects breaches compliance rules.","claimIds":["zaf-139"]}
],
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":2
},
{
