"body":[
{"text":"Internal records confirm former CPO Snir Havdala left Zafran to take a role at NVIDIA.","claimIds":["zaf-142","zaf-171"]},
{"text":"Discussing leadership churn during cold outreach undermines credibility and distracts from the value proposition.","claimIds":["zaf-142","zaf-171"]}
],
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Filming cocktail content in a home kitchen - CONTEXT_ONLY",
"body":[
{"text":"Contact data notes he shoots videos utilizing his iPhone \"in my kitchen at home\" and discusses running a Patreon.","claimIds":["zaf-160"]},
{"text":"Detailing his home filming environment crosses into personal territory prohibited by outreach rules.","claimIds":["zaf-160"]}
],
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":2
},
{
"h2":"Past rumors of Cisco acquisition refuted - REFUTED",
"body":[
{"text":"Media outlets circulated false reports suggesting Zafran was being sold to Cisco, which company leadership later corrected.","claimIds":["zaf-169"]},
{"text":"Bringing up debunked M&A rumors introduces confusion and distracts from commercial conversations.","claimIds":["zaf-169"]}
],
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Disputed $20M ARR estimates and high cash burn - UNRESOLVED",
"body":[
{"text":"Industry trackers estimated Zafran generated \"annual recurring revenue of roughly $20 million\" while flagging sustained cash losses.","claimIds":["zaf-170"]},
{"text":"Quoting unverified financial models damages trust before the conversation begins.","claimIds":["zaf-170"]}
],
"contactRefs":[],
"priority":1
},
{
"h2":"Rejected acquisition claims from July media coverage - REFUTED",
"body":[
{"text":"Journalists misinterpreted a strategic equity injection as a full buyout of Zafran Security prior to public clarification.","claimIds":["zaf-169"]},
{"text":"Ignoring past media inaccuracies keeps the conversation strictly focused on current capabilities.","claimIds":["zaf-169"]}
],
"contactRefs":[],
